# `artifacts.list`

Artifact metadata records, filterable by scope/mime/collection/item/owner.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.artifacts.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `scope` | `string` |
| `mime` | `string` |
| `collection_id` | `string` |
| `item_id` | `string` |
| `owner_actor` | `string` |
| `content_hash` | `string` |
| `limit` | `number` |

## Returns

`ArtifactsListResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `map` |
| `count` | `number` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call artifacts.list --json '{ "scope": "", "mime": "", "collection_id": "", "item_id": "", "owner_actor": "", "content_hash": "", "limit": 0 }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "artifact-checkout-audit",
      "name": "checkout-audit.md",
      "mime": "text/markdown",
      "size": 4096,
      "path": ".artifacts/checkout-audit.md",
      "scope": "project",
      "project_id": "harbor",
      "run_id": "job-checkout-flow-a1b2c3d",
      "owner_actor": "actor-rust-lane-harbor",
      "created_at": "2026-05-24T18:30:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "count": 1,
  "scope": "project"
}
```
